fast_cont_mat.py computes intra-protein contact occupancy based on the following conditions
    i) A contact is counted for two residues if any of two heavy atoms belonging to two residues are within the threshold distance
    ii) threshold distance is defined as 5 Angstorm
The script utilizes the MPI to paralellize contact occupancies across all residue pairs. Each processor takes a chunk of residue pairs and returns a csv file. If 5 processors are defined, the script returns 5 csv file each consisting of the contact occupancy data for its corresponding residue chunks.

Example:

mpiexec -np NUMBER_OF_PROCESSORS python fast_cont_mat.py <pdb_traj_file> <state: PRE/UNB/BND> <output_file_name> 

mpiexec -np 5 python fast_cont_mat.py ../../../LC3_MAIN_TRAJECTORIES/PROTEIN_ONLY_FITTED/membrane_bound_apo/LC3B_ER_SIM1_1us_dt1000.pdb UNB LC3B_MEM_BOUND_APO_S1_CONT_DAT


These individual files are merged with the script contact_map_maker.py

We simply define overall occupancy as the average occupancy across three replicates. This computed with the script consensus_cont_mat_maker.py.
